
TRIVNOTE is a trivial note-taking application.
It is trivial as in "requiring minimal effort"...

JDK 17 is the plan, eh. :x

Despite the self-deprecating naming, there are
still a handful of subsystems involved:

     org.rapidcow.trivnote.libexpr
           Serialization stuff
     org.rapidcow.trivnote.libflow
           Document flow model
     org.rapidcow.trivnote.libdraw
           Ink drawing model

     org.rapidcow.android.trivnote
           Scary stuff

The first three subsystems should be compile-
able without Android SDK.

Regarding licensing, see LICENSE.

WWW: https://foss.rapidcow.org/project/trivnote/
